<title>EGYPT: Egypt raises Nov Suez blend 5 cents against Brent.</title>
<headline>Egypt raises Nov Suez blend 5 cents against Brent.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-10-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt is raising the November prices of its Gulf of Suez Blend by 5 U.S. cents and lowering two other grades of crude by 15 cents against Dated Brent, an official from the state's Egyptian General Petroleum Corp (EGPC) said on Sunday.</p>
<p>Prices of the other three grades were unchanged from October against Dated Brent, the official told Reuters by telephone.</p>
<p>Here are the new differentials for November against Dated Brent (October differentials in brackets).</p>
<p>    Gulf of Suez    -$2.10  (-$2.15)</p>
<p>    Belayim	   -$3.15  (-$3.00)</p>
<p>    Ras Badran	-$3.35  (-$3.20)</p>
<p>    Ras Behar	 -$1.35  (-$1.35)</p>
<p>    Ras Gharib	-$4.00  (-$4.00)</p>
<p>    Zeit Bay	  -$1.40  (-$1.40)</p>
<p>-- Christine Hauser +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
